## Interface: 16001
## Version: @project-version@
## Title: AKForeverTradeFilter
## Notes: Trade chat shows trade. A line stays when it looks like game business - item links, WTS/WTB/LF, gold, professions, dungeons, zones - and goes when it carries real-world talk; plain chatter goes too unless you ask to keep it. A review window shows what went and why, and a training mode asks you line by line and keeps score against the filter's own call.
